NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000582 "=head1 DONATIONS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000583 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000584 "If you'd like to thank me for the work I've done on this module, please"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000585 "consider making a \"donation\" to me via PayPal. I spend a lot of free time"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000586 "creating free software, and would appreciate any support you'd care to offer."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000587 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000588 "Please note that B<I am not suggesting that you must do this> in order for me"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000589 "to continue working on this particular software. I will continue to do so,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000590 "inasmuch as I have in the past, for as long as it interests me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000591 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000592 "Similarly, a donation made in this way will probably not make me work on this"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000593 "software much more, unless I get so many donations that I can consider working"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000594 "on free software full time (let's all have a chuckle at that together)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000595 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000596 "To donate, log into PayPal and send money to autarch@urth.org, or use the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000597 "button at L<https://houseabsolute.com/foss-donations/>."
